  "contentHtml": "<p>수업 후 바로 올릴 수 있으면 좋은데 잘 안되네요.</p><p>겨울잠 잘 준비를 하고 있어 그전에 올리려고 합니다. ^^</p><p>동공반사 영상 (쥬라기 공원, 흰염소 동공 밤낮 차이)보여주고 지나갔었는데 각자의 눈으로 동공반사 과정을 찍고, 각자의 무릎 반사영상을 찍도록 했습니다.</p><p>나름 재밌게 했던 활동이라 올려봅니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f927e49fa0de928f1e9bd4c0ba2710941ca74d2c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f927e49fa0de928f1e9bd4c0ba2710941ca74d2c\" data-origin-width=\"1069\" data-origin-height=\"590\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48f7902d8f856029ecda5b18a8a995d6c11729b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48f7902d8f856029ecda5b18a8a995d6c11729b2\" data-origin-width=\"498\" data-origin-height=\"367\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/535e261b9674769262348203ee2b0a7bc8797e33\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/535e261b9674769262348203ee2b0a7bc8797e33\" data-origin-width=\"700\" data-origin-height=\"455\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6418c5ff5db708b11be33bacba5c11afd72190af?download\" data-file-name=\"VID_146341211_132344_569.mp4\" data-file-size=\"710289\" data-mimetype=\"video/mp4\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D761%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20241213103320&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6418c5ff5db708b11be33bacba5c11afd72190af')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">VID_146341211